1
00:06:13,333 --> 00:06:19,333
Bright lights. Hit songs. Country's biggest star. He'd trade it
all to find the kind of love he'd only sung about.

2
00:12:26,666 --> 00:12:32,666
Pure Country is a drama, music, romance film directed by Christopher Cain.

3
00:18:40,000 --> 00:18:46,000
Dusty Chandler is a super star in the country music world, but
his shows have the style of a '70s rock concert.

4
00:24:53,333 --> 00:24:59,333
One day he takes a walk - out of his overdone
concerts to find his real country roots.

5
00:31:06,666 --> 00:31:12,666
He's helped and hindered by friends and staff, but pushes on in his
search for a real music style as well as a real romance.

6
00:37:20,000 --> 00:37:26,000
Dusty Wyatt Chandler, played by George Strait.

7
00:43:33,333 --> 00:43:39,333
Lula Rogers, played by Lesley Ann Warren.

8
00:49:46,666 --> 00:49:52,666
Harley Tucker, played by Isabel Glasser.

9
00:56:00,000 --> 00:56:06,000
Buddy Jackson, played by Kyle Chandler.

10
01:02:13,333 --> 01:02:19,333
Earl Blackstock, played by John Doe.

11
01:08:26,666 --> 01:08:32,666
Ernest Tucker, played by Rory Calhoun.

12
01:14:40,000 --> 01:14:46,000
Pure Country is a 1992 American drama musical western film.

13
01:20:53,333 --> 01:20:59,333
It was directed by Christopher Cain and stars country music singer George Strait in his
acting debut, with Lesley Ann Warren, Isabel Glasser and Kyle Chandler.

14
01:27:06,666 --> 01:27:12,666
The film, while profitable with box office receipts of over $15 million against a $10 million budget, had a critical
reception generally for its storyline, although some critics spoke favorably of Strait's acting performance.

15
01:33:20,000 --> 01:33:26,000
The movie's corresponding soundtrack, recorded entirely by Strait, was a commercial success as well, certifying six
times platinum by the Recording Industry Association of America and charting three singles for Strait.

16
01:39:33,333 --> 01:39:39,333
The movie's success led to its expansion into the titular film series, including two
sequels as well as a stage musical of the film which debuted in 2017.

17
01:45:46,666 --> 01:45:52,666
The tone is emotional.
